ough the premise mechanism were biologically coherent. These failure conditions align with the biological reality documented in the papers.\n\nThe criterion is correctly scoped to the question about apples specifically, though it draws on general principles of triploid reproduction that apply across plants. Paper 12 specifically addresses apple (Malus) and confirms these mechanisms operate in that genus.",
